{:edb/db-before-t 1206 :edb/db-after-t 1207 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534519 50 #inst "2026-10-07T19:51:32.610Z" 13194139534519 true] [17592186068841 1020 #edb/ref 17592186292926 13194139534519 true] [17592186068841 1020 #edb/ref 17592186292930 13194139534519 true] [17592186068842 1020 #edb/ref 17592186292919 13194139534519 true] [17592186068843 1020 #edb/ref 17592186292912 13194139534519 true] [17592186068971 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534519 true] [17592186068971 1100 "$\\int 4{x}^{2}{sec}^{2}⁡({x}^{3})\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534519 true] [17592186068971 1100 "What is $\\displaystyle \\int4x^{2}\\sec^{2} (x^{3})dx$?" 13194139534519 false] [17592186068971 1145 "Let $u={x}^{3}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3{x}^{2}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u={x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 4{x}^{2}{sec}^{2}⁡({x}^{3})\\,\\text{d}x & =4\\int {sec}^{2}⁡({x}^{3})\\cdot {x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\int {sec}^{2}⁡(u)\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\int {sec}^{2}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{3}\\operatorname{tan}⁡({x}^{3})+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292912 1017 #edb/ref 17592186292913 13194139534519 true] [17592186292912 1089 "q-10045" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292912 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534519 true] [17592186292912 1100 "${\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292912 1113 #uuid "8ff1d836-eff6-5416-8eca-f38f9d49cb8f" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292912 1145 "Notice that the numerator is proportional to the derivative of the denominator, because\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\n$$\n\nSo, let $u=1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$ Differentiating, we have \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives\n\n| $x$ | $-1$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)$ | $1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\frac{1}{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)}^{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)}\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|{|}_{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)}^{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1)} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1))-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1))\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292913 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292914 13194139534519 true] [17592186292913 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292915 13194139534519 true] [17592186292913 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292916 13194139534519 true] [17592186292913 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292917 13194139534519 true] [17592186292913 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292918 13194139534519 true] [17592186292913 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534519 true] [17592186292913 1041 "selection" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292913 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292918 13194139534519 true] [17592186292913 1110 #uuid "a27a8296-3fbc-593b-990f-f3a8856f80ef" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292914 1034 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1))+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1))" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292914 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292914 1111 #uuid "8d34198a-cd07-5a08-8aa8-38d1e2ffa00f" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292915 1034 "-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2))-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2))" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292915 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292915 1111 #uuid "799aeb84-bdc6-54e2-9dcf-c48d0a462d72" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292916 1034 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1))+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1))" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292916 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292916 1111 #uuid "885b624b-818d-5f19-866a-7b99e939245a" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292917 1034 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2))-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2))" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292917 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292917 1111 #uuid "d032cadd-d126-5a42-9992-e1de343fc13a" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292918 1034 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1))-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1))" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292918 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292918 1111 #uuid "b901a701-0924-534c-b204-f56250140f6d" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292919 1017 #edb/ref 17592186292920 13194139534519 true] [17592186292919 1089 "q-3038" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292919 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534519 true] [17592186292919 1100 "Calculate the integral $\\int \\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡(1/x)}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292919 1113 #uuid "7b8b9fd5-920e-5e84-a786-4e2fa1bbbe7a" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292919 1145 "Let $u=\\frac{1}{x}.$ Differentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,⟹\\,-\\text{d}u=\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡(1/x)}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {sec}^{2}⁡(\\frac{1}{x})\\cdot \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {sec}^{2}⁡u\\cdot (-\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =-\\int {sec}^{2}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{tan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{1}{x})+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292920 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292921 13194139534519 true] [17592186292920 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292922 13194139534519 true] [17592186292920 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292923 13194139534519 true] [17592186292920 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292924 13194139534519 true] [17592186292920 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292925 13194139534519 true] [17592186292920 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534519 true] [17592186292920 1041 "selection" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292920 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292925 13194139534519 true] [17592186292920 1110 #uuid "5622a881-5efd-551d-bacc-0d4f2606b172" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292921 1034 "2\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{1}{x})+C" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292921 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292921 1111 #uuid "0eb4d2bb-fdc6-52d2-8431-faced7e42df6" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292922 1034 "\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{1}{x})+C" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292922 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292922 1111 #uuid "5ce02167-e712-5bf4-8f5e-56c70f44ee58" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292923 1034 "-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{1}{x})+C" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292923 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292923 1111 #uuid "1b16369d-f215-5951-975b-b93fbbea1d82" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292924 1034 "-\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\frac{1}{x})+C" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292924 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292924 1111 #uuid "1e2effa8-cb26-5d13-91b2-d7d58efee624" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292925 1034 "-\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{1}{x})+C" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292925 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292925 1111 #uuid "a3b721c0-e203-5134-a61c-c8c523281190" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292926 1017 #edb/ref 17592186292927 13194139534519 true] [17592186292926 1089 "q-350060" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292926 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534519 true] [17592186292926 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}3{sec}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292926 1113 #uuid "1647abd3-8524-50dc-9015-b53f7e45b70f" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292926 1145 "If we let $u=x-\\frac{\\pi }{4},$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\pi /4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $-\\pi /4$ | $0$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}3{sec}^{2}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})\\,\\text{d}x & =3{\\int }_{-\\pi /4}^{0}{sec}^{2}⁡(u)\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{tan}⁡(u){|}_{-\\pi /4}^{0} \\\\  & =3(0-(-1)) \\\\  & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292927 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292928 13194139534519 true] [17592186292927 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292929 13194139534519 true] [17592186292927 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534519 true] [17592186292927 1041 "field-1" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292927 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292928 13194139534519 true] [17592186292927 1110 #uuid "4665f929-297f-5960-b15f-c3fbbdc0c955" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292928 1034 "3" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292928 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292928 1111 #uuid "10be2153-58f9-5fdb-8aee-003db3a4ef43" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292929 1034 "-3" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292929 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292929 1111 #uuid "464a7fee-cdae-5411-ac36-0274f045c5da" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292930 1017 #edb/ref 17592186292931 13194139534519 true] [17592186292930 1089 "q-350071" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292930 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534519 true] [17592186292930 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{2\\pi /3}4\\operatorname{csc}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292930 1113 #uuid "d2e06399-eadb-50ef-a9f6-d3bbbc68b0aa" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292930 1145 "If we let $u=x-\\frac{\\pi }{6},$ then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives\n\n| $x$ | $\\pi /3$ | $2\\pi /3$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $\\pi /6$ | $\\pi /2$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{2\\pi /3}4\\operatorname{csc}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\operatorname{cot}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2}4\\operatorname{csc}⁡(u)\\operatorname{cot}⁡(u)\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{csc}⁡(u)\\operatorname{cot}⁡(u)\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-4\\operatorname{csc}⁡(u){|}_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =-4(\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})) \\\\  & =-4(1-2) \\\\  & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292931 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292932 13194139534519 true] [17592186292931 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534519 true] [17592186292931 1041 "field-1" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292931 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292932 13194139534519 true] [17592186292931 1110 #uuid "d3ee8efe-9659-5bca-8f1b-6ce5a82d861d" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292932 1034 "4" 13194139534519 true] [17592186292932 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534519 true] [17592186292932 1111 #uuid "8b720361-fa00-51ec-83b6-c9a264d424a4" 13194139534519 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-10045" 17592186292912 "q-10045/selection" 17592186292913 "q-10045/selection/063637862443b014f0588cc8974f065842c72645f73373e1e1cce0b8c2996cde" 17592186292914 "q-10045/selection/593efd0318a613038398afedd4862cae35d51c432458cefbdcbe51ad46710554" 17592186292915 "q-10045/selection/8f9c0400688c981a4ab6f3c8a8b13b41e2fddc39cb4df4a64bd042804d91d89c" 17592186292916 "q-10045/selection/b6381be2e3377271dd17d0f48d7dac8f0d64169838b880092cbd0e53c047de1c" 17592186292917 "q-10045/selection/fcea8cfb384bdba175fd1e9521ac46